  "title": "Body and daily care",
  "note": "To describe a person's features, say Person は Part が Adjective: 妹は髪が長いです \"My sister has long hair.\" The same pattern gives 頭が痛いです \"My head hurts.\" Daily-care verbs take を for the thing washed or brushed: 顔を洗います, 歯を磨きます. Entering a bath uses に: お風呂に入ります.",
